"""Hook groups of the differential harness and their full-tier shard counts.

One Bazel test per group (see BUILD.bazel) lets a change in one core module
rerun only its group while the other groups' results stay cached. The keys
must equal the groups of tools/reference-game/proxy/hook_registry.h and each
shard count must satisfy 1 <= shards <= members and 12 * shards >= members
(20 to 45 s per hook on the full tier under worker load, so a shard stays
under the large timeout); `groups_test` checks both against the registry.
The quick tier uses the same counts. A new group adds its line here; an
existing group needs a change only when it grows past a multiple of 12
hooks or when its full shards approach the timeout.
"""

